{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a loser in life, challenges the last gamble to win [money and women] in exchange for a lifetime of coal mine slavery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the biggest gambling house on earth called 'Babel'!!! Babel only deals with one game, the 'JANKEN' game, which is the fairest and most perfect balance in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win [money, women] with advanced psychological warfare and luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[How to play]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Play with scissors, rocks, and beam cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Get 2 cards each, totaling 6 cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Submit 1 card per turn to win or lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*When you win, you will see your stake and an image of the event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You lose when your fortune reaches $0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Tips]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can increase your chances of winning by using the various items you get each turn appropriately.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1st floor climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928770/d0c9480bfdc0d822f24f5843eea2f16baa0ac7e7.jpg"},{"name":"2nd floor climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928770/e250062f3ed612ec7bb50aa971c7764b77bad900.jpg"},{"name":"3rd floor climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928770/f8f3bda9031c2b900b0af1eee5e2234d10cc319c.jpg"},{"name":"4th floor climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928770/5f6051dd072bc6c711fa580dab4d94b801f97d8e.jpg"},{"name":"Zanken beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928770/efb420c3ffca0b5d3399d17204413aab7afde5a9.jpg"},{"name":"6th floor climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst